<p>Like <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cybersqyd" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5336470); return false;">cybersqyd</a></span> I think this gets a bit over the top&#8230; I like the idea of the weird kitchen with faceless chefs&#8230; and then I lose all interest when its a #scary door that is forbidden and the chef kills the agents&#8230;</p>
